    "detailed_description": "This game is independently developed by the author in his spare time after work, so please go easy on any criticism.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a game where you can choose different heroes to occupy territory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are currently 4 heroes, each with their own unique skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn each battle, you choose one hero to enter a fixed number of grid scenes. Use the hero's skills (keys 1, 2, 3, etc.) to attack the grid and monsters in the scene.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDifferent monsters will randomly appear on the grid to prevent you from occupying it!!! They will use their skills to reclaim the grid from you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTry to have fun using different skills to occupy the territory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you have any good suggestions for modifications, please feel free to comment and leave a message.<br />\r\nOr join the QQ group to discuss together: 907462326",
